        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Taurus &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>Aldebaran's charge &mdash; the one that ends the fight.</em></p><p>Each creature in the line takes @Damage[8d8[bludgeoning]] damage with a basic Fortitude save. A creature that fails is pushed to the end of the line and knocked prone; one that critically fails takes an additional @Damage[4d8[bludgeoning]] damage and is stunned 2.</p><p>Any wall, door, or structure in the line with Hardness less than 20 is destroyed. The horn does not go around things.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8, and the critical-failure damage by 1d8.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
